WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
H-h-h-how's it going bros, my name is Pewdiepie!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.680
And welcome to another gameplay on this channel!

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.720
I know a lot of you guys have been waiting for this.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.880
No, for real I've been. *chuckles*

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.580
UNDERTALE 2!!!

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.960
So, this game came out, it's called "Deltarune."

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.480
It's... basically Undertale 2.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.040
I think... I'm not sure....

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.640
Uh, they released chapter 1.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.640
But i-i-t's not just a chapter, it's an actual full game.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.720
As far as i can- I know, it's 2 hours or something long, so...

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.680
I'm freakin' pumped!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:35.440
Uh, I loved playing Undertale,
I think a lot of people enjoyed it as well.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.820
So let's just jump into it.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:42.940
I wanna just show this, just cuz when you
install the game it says "SURVEY_PROGRAM".

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.360
"YOU ACCEPT EVERYTHING THAT WILL HAPPEN FROM NOW ON."

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.360
Yes, except... I won't accept putting on Start Menu Shortcut.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.640
That was an actual joke.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.080
Let's do this...

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.640
Okay.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:00:59.840
Oh God! What did it say?

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:01.180
I was adjusting my window.

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:03.700
"Are we ready... connected?

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.960
It's almost the same.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.100
I guess we are.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:10.620
Ok! It's, Undertale.

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.120
Ok, this is epic!

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:13.580
"Excellent."

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.880
Where is Sans? Come on.
"Truly excellent."

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:23.800
"Now."

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.240
Now what? "We may begin."

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:29.940
*exitedly claps*

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.880
I know the future everyone, guys.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:32.620
Oh, Jesus!

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:37.380
"First."

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.580
"You must create a vessel."

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:43.660
Okay.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.280
"Select the head that you prefer."

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:49.140
Alright, we got....

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.460
Mmm... this one.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.640
"Select the torso that you prefer."

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:02.180
Wow! There's so many different options!
How could I possibly pick one?

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.080
Hmm... Hmm..! I think-!

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:05.600
I think I'll go-

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:07.720
I think I'll go with that one.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:12.520
"Select the legs." Oh wow!
There are so many different options!

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.240
How could I possibly pick one?

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.180
"This is your body."

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:25.460
"Do you accept it?" Well, does anyone truly accept their body?

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.160
That was so deep.... "Excellent."

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:34.580
"You have created a wonderful form." Why, thank you, that's the first time anyone told me that.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:35.560
"Now."

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.420
Except when I go to the bathroom.
"Let us shape...

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:40.440
"...its mind..."

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.140
as your own."

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.960
"What is its favourite food?"

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.220
Uhhm...

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:47.760
Pain.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:49.500
Taste's good right?

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.140
"Your favorite blood type?"

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.120
Uhh...

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:54.180
I think I'm B, I'm not sure....

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:58.520
Favorite blood type... "What color does it like the most?"

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:00.620
Cyan is pretty interesting.

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:03.540
"Please give it a gift."

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:08.200
A gift of... mind.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:11.280
I'll be a psychic Pokemon.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:15.460
"How do you feel about your creation? (It will not hear.)"

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.600
Are you sure? *laughs*

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.480
I... I'm hopeful.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.080
"Have you answered honestly?"

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:26.580
Uhh...

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:27.600
Yeah, I think so....

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:32.840
