00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:33.760
Uhh...

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:37.100
No.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:39.540
"Understood."

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:42.920
"Name your vessel."

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:43.840
Uhh...

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:47.000
Well... of course, you know what's happening.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.540
You know what's... has to be.

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:50.480
The legend has to return.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.840
Do not say the word.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.020
Oh!

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:59.120
