00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.940
Oh... well I guess I'll pick 'Felix.'

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.220
Just cuz usually these games are really meta.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.840
So I want it to play into that.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.000
"'Felix.'"

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.000
What a silly na- "Excellent."

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:21.500
Yes.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.300
Thank you for not ripping into my name.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.580
"Truly excellent."

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:26.560
"'Felix.'"

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.140
