00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:34.880
"Your answers"

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:39.100
"Your wonderful... creation!"

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.780
"Will now be discar-..."

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.060
