00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:34.640
Damn, I got a lot of trophies.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.300
"It's a computer desk. There are many boxes under it filled with old books."

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:41.180
Alright, let's just get moving.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.220
Damn, I look good.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:46.380
