00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:40.980
"Quiet people piss me off."

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:47.240
"You think just 'cause you don't say anything...

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:49.380
"...I can't tell EXACTLY what you're thinking?"

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:53.180
"It's OVER! I caught Susie eating all the chalk!"

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:57.140
"This was her LAST chance! Now she'll finally be expelled!"

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:00.920
"Haha... come on Kris. Don't act shocked. You know it's true."

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.860
"Everyone's waiting for it. Everyone wants it."

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:07.140
"So, congrats, Kris. You got me. I'm done for."

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.760
"Just, lemme say one little thing."

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.540
"Seems like a waste to get expelled just for having a snack.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:19.380
"So, Kris, if I KNOW you're gonna pull the trigger..."

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:20.640
"Heh heh heh..."

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:24.200
"Why don't I just get expelled for some REAL carnage?"

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:26.760
"Kris... How do you feel..."

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:27.620
Oh God.

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:31.300
"About losing your face?"

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:36.340
I feel strongly against it. Strongly against it. STRONGLY AGAINST IIIIT!!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.080
"Nah."

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:40.800
*chuckles*

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.540
"Kris... You've got a good mother."

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.920
"...it'd be a shame to make her bury her child."

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.040
"Alright. Let's get this over with."

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:56.440
"We'll get more chalk. Mosey back to class. And then, Kris...

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:59.480
"YOU'LL do our project. How's that sound?"

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:00.780
Uh-

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:02.180
"Don't bother answering."

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:04.200
"If you haven't gotten it by now..."

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.180
"Your choices don't matter."

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:08.820
Hey, I don't like the way if you don't talk

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:10.220
By the way, don't talk.

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:11.340
"Let's go, freak."

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.660
Jesus Christ, I almost died out there.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.060
Oh God, he's looking at me.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.060
What happens if I just leave?

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.260
"Kris...? You just gonna skip school...?

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:26.560
"What, am I supposed to snitch on YOU? That'd be rich, huh?"

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.460
"Nah, I wouldn't. Get back here."

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:33.000
"Kris, if you skip school, your mom'll have a heart attack."

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.320
"Kris, if-" Ok

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:38.360
Alright, alright, fine, I won't give my mom a heart attack.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:41.700
"God, can you walk any slower, or what?"

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.460
"Nah, I get it.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.500
Not used to walking around without someone holding your hand?

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.160
"Come on, freak."

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.900
Jeez, sheesh...

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:58.840
Well, here's the closet. Too bad...

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:01.720
"We were just starting to have fun."

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:06.600
That's a very ominous closet... I must say...

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:08.220
Oh

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:13.380
"Hey, Kris, is it me, or... is it REALLY dark in there?"

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:19.980
"What's the holdup, Kris? Are you gonna go in or what?"

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:26.560
"Fine! If you're gonna be a WIMP, then I'll..."

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:33.280
"We'll go-" *laughs* "We'll both go in at the same time!!"

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:34.920
Seems fair.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:38.600
"See? Why are you so scared?"

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:40.900
"There's nothing in here but old papers."

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.800
"Let's try to find a lightswitch."

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.060
"Kris, if you leave me here, I'll..." Ok, alright.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.200
Ok, ok, I'm here, ok, what's up?

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:50.760
"That's weird... I can't find a switch."

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:55.340
"Guess it's further in..." Oh God, no, God, ah, ah, God

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:59.920
"Uhhh... kind of big for a closet, huh...?"

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:02.780
"You'd think we'd have reached the end by now..."

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:10.600
"Hey, Kris. I think this closet's, uh... broken."

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:12.480
"There aren't any walls."

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:17.240
"Well, we've worked hard enough."

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.140
"If Alphys wants chalk so bad, she can get it herself."

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.260
"Let's split."

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:25.160
We did it, guys.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:27.360
Ah, shi- *instant regret*

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:29.300
Damnit!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:30.400
"What the...!?

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:35.260
"Hey, this isn't funny! LET US OUT! LET US..."

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:41.500
"The floor, it's...!

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:44.680
*shookth*

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.440
That's DOOOPE!

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:50.020
We're falling down!

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.580
It's all happening again!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:59.460
Are we gonna meet some monsters?

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:06.420
Damn, I look...

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:11.520
Is that an armor? What is that? I look cool. Look at that!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.960
(High-pitched voice) Save Station! Battle up.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.660
"At times you see it flickering. The light only you can see."

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:23.560
"By second nature, you reach out, and..." save it.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.960
Heck yeah, guys. Look, we're doing great.

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:28.220
So proud.

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:32.220
Ok, well this is very ominous. Ah, jeez.

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:36.620
Alien nipple. It's waving at me. 'Hello, alien nipple'

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.280
Good to see you, alien nipple.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:45.120
It looks like a... looks like a face.

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.060
O-kay, it is a face.

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:49.740
Wait... I saw something moving up there!

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:52.180
You see it?

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:56.500
Ahh! Ok, I'm fine.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:01.120
Cool, this... Oh that's definitely a face!

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:03.640
What is happening here?

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.880
"There's something glowing inside. Take it?"

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:10.800
"You got the Glowshard."

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:14.000
What in the world is a Glows-hard?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.020
*snickers*

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:16.580
GOOD NAME!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.260
Ah, jeez. Okay...

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.120
Not on my watch, alien nipples.

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:26.360
I don't think so!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:30.500
Save Sta- "You bathed your body in the light."

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:33.460
"A power shines within you, breaking through the darkness."

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:36.680
"Any pain you may have had melted away..." I have HP fully restored

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.200
Ok, doing well.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:42.080
"In this land, only eyes blinded by darkness can see the way..."

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:43.880
What is this, a puzzle?

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:53.360
Wow! I must be some kind of genius. Incredible.

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:56.440
Ew...

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.160
Do I get anything for activating thaaat?

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:01.280
EWW!

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:03.020
EWW!

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:04.100
Ay!

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:05.780
You saw that.

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.360
Oh! Again

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:10.600
Eh-

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:14.640
"Hey! Back off! Come any closer and I'll...!!"

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:15.680
*chuckles*

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:20.560
"K- Kris... Phew! Hey, don't scare me like that, dumbass!"

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:23.140
"Unless you WANT to get clocked in the face, heh."

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:27.100
"Anyway, enough screwing around. We gotta find a way outta here."

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:32.160
"Ummm... where is 'here' anyway?" *laughs*

00:20:33.220 --> 00:20:37.800
"It doesn't matter! YOU got us into this mess, YOU get us out!"

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.740
(In surprise) How did I do it? I didn't do anything!

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:42.520
"Lead the way, Kris!"

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.240
Look, who's the scaredy-cat, huh?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:49.760
"Oh my God. Nevermind. You walk WAY too slow" *chuckles* Jesus...

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:51.600
Alright, okay.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.400
Where'd he go?

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:58.860
Who's this?

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:03.620
"Hey, Kris. There's someone up there waving at us."

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:04.940
"Any idea what they want...?"

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:09.400
Sans! It's Sans! Whoa!

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:12.360
(High-pitched voice) Sa- "R-run Kris!"

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:13.900
Ah God!

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:14.880
Ah, ah

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:15.860
Ah

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:20.180
It's okay. I played Undertale 2... I mean 1.

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.700
I know how to do this. I'm an expert!

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:28.920
I'm channeling all my epic gamer skills.

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:33.180
This is a ZERO DEATH run, everyone. I will die-

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:35.000
Oh, God, that was actually close.

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:36.260
OHHH!

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:37.860
PROOO!

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:39.220
*high-pitched voice* Prooo!

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:41.500
Made it! "Kris, down here!"

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:42.500
Ok!

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:45.460
Ay! Whoa!

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:47.340
Sheesh!

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:48.340
Ay!

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:50.060
(Anime voice) Stop it!

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.140
Everyone!

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:53.460
EVERYONE!

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:54.940
I have an announcent!

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:57.160
Stop!

00:21:58.040 --> 00:21:59.780
Look at that (shoo shoo)

00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:04.880
What a waterslide.

00:22:05.900 --> 00:22:07.380
Damn, I love the art...

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:11.180
It's so simple and still so effective.

00:22:12.340 --> 00:22:14.000
"Oh, you're not dead. Sweet."

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:16.260
"Got an idea what the heck this place is?"

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:17.340
"...me neither."

00:22:17.760 --> 00:22:20.760
"Wonder if there's anyone in that building up there...?"

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:25.280
(High-pitched voice) Save Station.

00:22:25.560 --> 00:22:28.460
"In front of you, a castle looms beneath the empty town."

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:31.900
"A black geyser- (Pffts with burp) emerges from it..."

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:34.040
"...piercing endlessly into the sky."

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:36.560
"The power of this place shines within you."

00:22:38.900 --> 00:22:39.880
Eye Puzzle...

00:22:40.740 --> 00:22:41.720
What is this?

00:22:46.480 --> 00:22:47.520
"A castle...?"

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:53.020
"Why the hell is there a castle inside a supply closet...?"

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:55.340
"Welcome, heroes...!"

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:56.760
"Who's there!?"

00:22:57.160 --> 00:23:00.880
"Do not be alarmed... I am not your enemy."

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:03.920
"Please come forward, both of you..."

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:08.620
Oh. It's Sans! It's gotta be Sans."

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:13.720
"Welcome. I am the Prince of this Kingdom... The KINGDOM OF DARKNESS!"

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:14.740
*laughs*

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:17.740
"Kris, Susie... There is a LEGEND in this land."

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:22.320
"A LEGEND that one day, two HEROES of LIGHT will arrive,"

00:23:22.320 --> 00:23:26.820
"And fulfill the ancient prophecy, foretold by time and space."

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:31.820
"Please, Heroes... Listen to my tale..."

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:33.640
"Very well, then..."

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:35.860
Alright.

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:37.540
Let's listen to that...

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:42.720
"Once upon a time, a LEGEND was whispered among shadows."

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:48.420
"It was a LEGEND of HOPE. It was a LEGEND of DREAMS."

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:52.100
"It was a LEGEND of LIGHT. It was a LEGEND of DARK."

00:23:52.800 --> 00:23:57.560
"This is the legend of DELTA RUNE." Deltarune!

00:23:58.100 --> 00:23:58.880
My God...

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:04.300
"For millenia, LIGHT and DARK have lived in balance,"

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:07.860
"Bringing peace to the-" This is very Zelda.

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:09.920
"Bringing peace to the WORLD."

00:24:10.040 --> 00:24:12.640
"But if this harmony were to shatter..."

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:16.980
"A terrible calamity would occur."

00:24:19.060 --> 00:24:21.580
"The sky will run black with terror..."

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:26.100
"And the land will crack with fear."

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:28.580
That sounds like a bad time.

00:24:28.960 --> 00:24:31.180
"Then, her heart pounding..."

00:24:32.900 --> 00:24:36.400
"The EARTH will draw her final breath."

00:24:37.420 --> 00:24:40.440
"Only then, shining with hope..."

00:24:41.880 --> 00:24:45.180
"Three HEROES appear at WORLDS' edge"

00:24:46.500 --> 00:24:53.200
"A HUMAN, a MONSTER and a PRINCE FROM THE DARK."

00:24:53.720 --> 00:24:54.260
Wow.

00:24:54.260 --> 00:24:56.120
That fits our description perfectly.

00:24:56.520 --> 00:24:59.620
"Only they can seal the fountains." The fountains...

00:25:00.060 --> 00:25:01.000
The geyser?

00:25:03.540 --> 00:25:05.320
"And banish the Angel's wrath."

00:25:05.500 --> 00:25:07.840
"Only then will balance be restored,"

00:25:09.600 --> 00:25:12.300
"And the WORLD saved from destruction."

00:25:14.160 --> 00:25:16.560
"Today, The FOUNTAIN OF DARKNESS-"

00:25:18.660 --> 00:25:21.260
"The GEYSER that gives this land form-"

00:25:23.420 --> 00:25:26.280
"Stands tall at the center of the kingdom."

00:25:29.700 --> 00:25:31.160
That's kinda weird...

00:25:31.160 --> 00:25:34.480
"But recently, another fountain has appeared on the horizon..."

00:25:34.700 --> 00:25:37.100
And it's bigger than ours, I don't like it.

00:25:37.100 --> 00:25:40.000
"And with it, the balance of LIGHT and DARK begins to shift..."

00:25:42.980 --> 00:25:45.480
This is... this is interesting...

00:25:45.480 --> 00:25:48.440
I'm curious, tell me more, Prince Of Darkness.

00:25:48.940 --> 00:25:52.120
"Kris, Susie... Thank you for listening to my long tale."

00:25:52.380 --> 00:25:54.620
It was very long, I'm glad you added that.

00:25:55.000 --> 00:25:58.400
"I deeply believe you two are the HEROES of the LEGEND."

00:25:58.800 --> 00:26:02.080
"That despite whatever enemies you may face..."

00:26:02.720 --> 00:26:06.300
"You two have the COURAGE to SAVE THE WORLD."

00:26:06.960 --> 00:26:08.080
"DELTA WARRIORS!"

00:26:08.540 --> 00:26:11.300
"Please, won't you accept your destiny...?"

00:26:13.180 --> 00:26:15.320
"Uhhh... Nah." *chuckles* Jesus Christ...

00:26:16.700 --> 00:26:18.360
"W...what?"

00:26:19.820 --> 00:26:21.800
"Me? Some kind of hero or something...?"

00:26:22.560 --> 00:26:23.840
"You've got the wrong person."

00:26:24.660 --> 00:26:28.560
"B-but Susie, without you, the... the world will..."

00:26:29.240 --> 00:26:32.980
"So what? If the world gets destroyed... It's none of my damn business."

00:26:33.780 --> 00:26:35.660
"Might even be kind of fun, honestly."

00:26:37.260 --> 00:26:38.320
"Anyway, Kris..."

00:26:38.320 --> 00:26:40.860
"If YOU wanna play pretend with this weirdo... "

00:26:41.420 --> 00:26:42.220
"Stick around."

00:26:42.640 --> 00:26:44.420
"I'M going to find a way out of here."

00:26:45.160 --> 00:26:46.360
"Sus-susie... Wait!"

00:26:49.740 --> 00:26:50.560
What?

00:26:51.500 --> 00:26:52.900
It's SANS!! *chuckles*

00:26:53.140 --> 00:26:57.460
"Ho ho ho! The heroes are already running away..."

00:26:57.660 --> 00:27:00.140
"And they didn't even know I was here."

00:27:00.780 --> 00:27:04.300
"My dad's gonna make me Son of the Month!" *laughs*

00:27:05.640 --> 00:27:08.760
How many sons does he have? Lemme guess. One.

00:27:09.120 --> 00:27:10.340
"Who the hell are you!?"

00:27:10.800 --> 00:27:11.700
"I'm...!"

00:27:13.180 --> 00:27:15.180
"THE BAD GUY! *laughs*

00:27:17.240 --> 00:27:20.400
"You CLOWNS want to seal our DARK FOUNTAIN, huh!?"

00:27:20.800 --> 00:27:23.260
"And - STILL picturing you guys as CLOWNS -"

00:27:25.040 --> 00:27:27.640
"Save the world from ETERNAL DARKNESS, huh!?"

00:27:28.120 --> 00:27:28.740
"Eh."

00:27:29.940 --> 00:27:31.340
"Don't try to deny it...!"

00:27:31.520 --> 00:27:33.620
"We both know you'll go EAST!"

00:27:34.420 --> 00:27:35.920
"It's your only way home!"

00:27:36.600 --> 00:27:39.240
"But, I, LANCER," Lancer... *snickers*

00:27:39.240 --> 00:27:40.400
"won't let you go there!"

00:27:41.140 --> 00:27:44.140
"And I've got a flawless two step plan to ensure it."

00:27:44.420 --> 00:27:46.100
"Step one. I thrash you."

00:27:46.840 --> 00:27:48.280
"Step two. You lose!"

00:27:48.460 --> 00:27:49.860
You Thrash You Lose!

00:27:50.480 --> 00:27:52.440
"Hmm. Nice plan, kid."

00:27:53.320 --> 00:27:54.440
"R-really...?"

00:27:55.460 --> 00:27:59.480
"Yeah, actually... Mind if we use it on you instead?"

00:28:00.380 --> 00:28:00.880
Oh!

00:28:01.400 --> 00:28:01.900
Oh!

00:28:02.380 --> 00:28:03.660
It's fighting time.

00:28:05.020 --> 00:28:06.360
Uhh, Kris can act.

00:28:07.840 --> 00:28:08.780
Uh, warning.

00:28:09.680 --> 00:28:12.520
"You tell Lancer to watch out for Susie's attack."

00:28:12.820 --> 00:28:14.000
"He redies himself."

00:28:15.880 --> 00:28:16.680
(facepalm)

00:28:17.480 --> 00:28:20.340
"Halt, clowns! This bike is fueled by victory!!!"

00:28:21.500 --> 00:28:22.300
Oh God.

00:28:22.540 --> 00:28:23.240
Ooh-

00:28:25.380 --> 00:28:27.900
"Dunno how I got an axe, but, like, that's cool." *laughs*

00:28:27.900 --> 00:28:28.640
Oh yeah!

00:28:31.200 --> 00:28:31.960
Almost.

00:28:34.040 --> 00:28:37.800
"I love to get thrashed... just kidding-!" Oh. God.

00:28:38.960 --> 00:28:39.460
Hey!

00:28:42.820 --> 00:28:44.420
