00:46:33.440 --> 00:46:36.580
"Yahoo! Susie's back on the team! Cue the fanfare!"

00:46:37.760 --> 00:46:45.580
(Passionately singing) "SUSIE JOINED THE PAR-TY!"

00:46:50.080 --> 00:46:59.780
