00:47:22.280 --> 00:47:22.780
Oh God.

00:47:23.020 --> 00:47:24.620
Susie, do NOT hurt this creature.

00:47:25.500 --> 00:47:27.080
Do NOT hurt this adorable creature!

00:47:28.700 --> 00:47:31.880
