00:47:32.800 --> 00:47:33.440
Ok, so...

00:47:34.300 --> 00:47:34.800
Act.

00:47:39.300 --> 00:47:40.620
No, let's defend, first.

00:47:46.560 --> 00:47:48.200
NO! NO!

00:47:51.300 --> 00:47:53.140
WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU DOING!

00:47:54.620 --> 00:47:55.320
NO!

00:47:56.500 --> 00:47:57.080
NO!

00:47:58.820 --> 00:48:03.320
