(From the void) I'm quitting there

00:48:05.200 --> 00:48:06.640
I'm not killing that thing!

00:48:07.580 --> 00:48:08.760
Ok, there's a Save here.

00:48:09.060 --> 00:48:11.520
"Um, Susie, I suppose you missed what I said earlier..."

00:48:11.780 --> 00:48:12.940
"As heroes, we have th-"

00:48:13.760 --> 00:48:14.680
Ok, alright.

00:48:15.960 --> 00:48:19.900
Ok, I'll save here, and then I'll- in the next episode I'll go back... cuz clearly I messed up.

00:48:20.960 --> 00:48:23.500
Oh God, I sa-, oh God, oh God, no, no.

00:48:23.500 --> 00:48:26.560
I thought I had a different save file. I thought I had a different Save file.

00:48:26.820 --> 00:48:27.660
I thought I- ABORT!

00:48:28.140 --> 00:48:28.960
Oh God, oh God.

